      "name": "Index Nav",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "index-nav",
      "description": "Step navigation in the top bar. Active step is a 2px accent bottom rule.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item is-active\"><span class=\"ds-nav-num\">01</span>Profile</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\"><span class=\"ds-nav-num\">02</span>Interview</button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\"><span class=\"ds-nav-num\">03</span>Index</button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;gap:20px}.ds-nav-item{display:inline-flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;padding:8px 0;border:0;border-bottom:2px solid transparent;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer}.ds-nav-item:hover{color:var(--text);border-bottom-color:var(--line-strong)}.ds-nav-item.is-active{color:var(--text);border-bottom-color:var(--accent)}.ds-nav-num{font-family:var(--accent-mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.ds-nav-item.is-active .ds-nav-num{color:var(--accent)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rank Rail Row",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "rank-rail",
      "description": "The signature component. Log-scale rail, student rank fixed at center, closing rank ticked left (reach) or right (safe).",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-rail\"><div class=\"ds-rail-track\"><span class=\"ds-rail-tick\"></span><span class=\"ds-rail-marker\" data-state=\"reach\"></span></div><span class=\"ds-rail-label\">Reach</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-rail{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px}.ds-rail-track{position:relative;flex:1;min-width:110px;height:22px}.ds-rail-track::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:10px;left:0;right:0;height:2px;background:var(--line)}.ds-rail-tick{position:absolute;top:4px;left:50%;width:2px;height:14px;background:var(--neutral-data)}.ds-rail-marker{position:absolute;top:3px;left:30%;width:2px;height:16px;background:var(--reach)}.ds-rail-marker::before{content:'';position:absolute;top:-3px;left:-2px;width:6px;height:6px;background:inherit;transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-rail-label{min-width:46px;text-align:right;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;color:var(--muted)}"
    },
    {
